---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
---

<Base title="About us" description="Limitless PA connects Pennsylvania families of kids with special needs to welcoming places, events, and community.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Limitless PA</span>
      <h1>Connecting families. Celebrating inclusion. Strengthening community.</h1>
      <p>
        We help Pennsylvania families of kids with special needs — especially autistic kids — find the places and people
        that make everyday life a little easier.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Why we started</h2>
        <p>
          For a lot of families, a haircut, a trip to the store, or a birthday party at the trampoline park takes real
          planning. Loud music, bright lights, long lines, and crowded rooms can turn a simple outing into a hard day — and
          too often, families just stop going.
        </p>
        <p>
          But all over Pennsylvania, businesses and organizations are quietly making changes: a barber who keeps a quiet
          room in the back, a theater that keeps the lights up, a museum with headphones at the front desk. Those places are
          hard to find. Limitless PA brings them together in one spot — and helps more businesses join them.
        </p>

        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <ul class="do-list">
          <li><Icon name="search" size={22} /><span><strong>Find and share welcoming places.</strong> We collect businesses and venues that have made real sensory-friendly accommodations, and we check the details.</span></li>
          <li><Icon name="calendar" size={22} /><span><strong>Promote inclusive events.</strong> Sensory-friendly showings, adaptive sports, meetups, and family events from hosts across the state.</span></li>
          <li><Icon name="store" size={22} /><span><strong>Encourage businesses to adapt.</strong> We share simple, low-cost ideas that help any business welcome every kid.</span></li>
          <li><Icon name="people" size={22} /><span><strong>Build community.</strong> Recommendations come from families who’ve been there. That’s what makes this guide useful.</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What we’re not</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>We are not medical providers, and we don’t claim to be.</strong> We don’t list or recommend doctors,
          therapists, or clinical services, and nothing on this site is medical, therapeutic, or legal advice. We focus on
          everything else: the fun, everyday parts of life that every kid deserves.
        </p>

        <h2>How listings work</h2>
        <p>
          Anyone can suggest a place. Before we list it, we confirm what the business offers. Listings are free. Because
          programs change, we include the date we last checked each listing and always recommend calling ahead.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="side">
        <div class="card logo-card">
          <Logo variant="stacked" height={150} />
        </div>
        <div class="card help">
          <h2>Ways to help</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/suggest/">Suggest a place</a></li>
            <li><a href="/submit-event/">Share an event</a></li>
            <li><a href="/for-businesses/">Tell a business about us</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact/">Volunteer or partner with us</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }
  .prose h2 {
    color: var(--brand-primary);
  }
  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .do-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0 !important;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .do-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .do-list :global(svg) {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--brand-green);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .side {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .logo-card {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .logo-card :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 240px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .help {
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--brand-green-soft);
    border: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .help h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--brand-primary);
  }
  .help ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }
</style>
